+ * allocator. That is in-sandbox and self-inflicted, it ends when the store is
+ * torn down (the engine's stop paths still reach those threads), and it is the
+ * reason "a worker dies alone, siblings continue" is a statement about the
+ * HOST rather than a promise to the guest.
